    "en": {
      "trackName": "Bean Break Master-Watch Game",
      "description": "Bean Break Master is a casual puzzle game for iPhone and Apple Watch.\nObserve how the beans are arranged in each level and use simple, intuitive controls to complete the objective. Every level has a different layout, so you’ll need to look carefully and find the right solution.\nFeatures: • Supports iPhone and Apple Watch • 100 fun levels built into the Apple Watch version • Simple controls and easy to learn • Short levels, perfect for quick play sessions • No registration or login required • Clean and easy-to-understand interface\nWhether you’re taking a break or commuting, open Bean Break Master anytime and enjoy a relaxing puzzle challenge.",
      "releaseNotes": "Added a beginner tutorial with an animated finger icon pointing to the color box to help players get started quickly.\nAfter the first successful placement into the box, the tutorial automatically disappears and saves the completion status, so it will not appear again.\nBeginner guidance is now supported on both iPhone and Apple Watch, while keeping the existing game layout, gameplay, and level progress unchanged.",
