      "version": "2.0",
      "releaseNotes": "Enjoy refreshed Halloween-inspired visuals and a cute Pumpkin Ghost app icon.\nSwitch between the Playful Ghost and the Little Cyclops. Each character matches the color of its bead box.\nChoose characters and themes on Apple Watch. Your preferences are saved, while the familiar layout stays unchanged.\nPlace multiple boxes of the same color in available holding slots, with smoother bead transfers and improved empty-box cleanup.",
      "seenAt": "2026-09-17T09:04:06Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.1",
      "releaseNotes": "Discover a refreshed Halloween arcade look, a new app icon, and switchable themes.\n• Choose between the Playful Ghost and the Little Cyclops. Each helper matches the color of its bead box.\n• Place multiple boxes of the same color in the holding area whenever space is available.\n• Enjoy slower carrying animations, with helpers setting off one after another in a closely spaced line.\n• Character selections are saved instantly. The panel closes automatically so you can continue playing without an extra confirmation.",
      "seenAt": "2026-09-17T22:35:39Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2.2",
      "releaseNotes": "Added a beginner tutorial with an animated finger icon pointing to the color box to help players get started quickly.\nAfter the first successful placement into the box, the tutorial automatically disappears and saves the completion status, so it will not appear again.\nBeginner guidance is now supported on both iPhone and Apple Watch, while keeping the existing game layout, gameplay, and level progress unchanged.",
      "seenAt": "2026-09-18T18:18:41Z"
    }
  ],
